--- a/lammps/NOTICE.md
+++ b/lammps/NOTICE.md
@@ -50,3 +50,10 @@
 the upstream commit identified above. This notice is intended to make the
 modified status and modification date explicit while preserving all upstream
 license and attribution notices.
+
+On 19 November 2026, the SPINGNN overlay was updated with unified frozen,
+moving-lattice and isotropic canonical-volume integration by the cached-field integrator (CFI), including
+the centered SIB control and fixed-storage call counters. Spin-aware ML pairs
+are relocated without numerical changes. The set-spin atom-variable mapping
+correction is retained. The native spin/sib_npt cache path is unchanged.
+Experimental styles from earlier development are not included.
